    Issue 1227 peer correction VM1227-PEER-001: exact racemic identity is CHEBI:748116
    (lipoic acid, alpha), whose primary ChEBI release 255 statements include DL synonyms
    and a direct superclass CHEBI:60911 (racemate, an equimolar enantiomer mixture).
    It is distinct from the generic parent CHEBI:16494. TCI L0058 (https://www.tcichemicals.com/US/en/p/L0058)
    independently corroborates the explicit DL name and CAS1077-28-7 but does not
    establish DSMZ procurement. No active local owner holds CHEBI:748116, so EXTERNAL_TERM
    is deliberate. Literal amount, source preparation and all holds remain; no generic
    lipoic-acid components or owner roles are changed.'
